     C01 CTL_PANEL -> CHG [firmware]: FW-A01 to A03, A16, A17: RSNS_RAC, IIN_HOST 4.70 A, ChargeCurrent at most 3.0 A, the charger's 175 s watchdog; CHG_INHIBIT (FW-A14) and rules R-a to R-d (R-126); under (B1) EN_OOA 0 at boot, ChargeCurrent 0 A at POR, R-b' (R-158)
     C02 CTL_PANEL -> LOADS [firmware]: the expanders (FW-A08): SLOT_EN, DEV_EN, HEAT_EN; the margin hold (R-138, R-139); MAIN and PI_KILL (FW-A10 to A12)
     C03 CTL_PANEL -> USBC [firmware and hardware]: PD_SW_EN AND OUTLET_OK (FW-A06); the tablet's window (a proposal)
     C04 CTL_PANEL -> POE [firmware and hardware]: POE_SW_EN AND OUTLET_OK (FW-A06); U17 read on R227 (FW-A09, R-27)
     C05 CTL_PANEL -> PA [firmware]: the key-down rules K1 to K5 and C4 (FW-A05, D-11): at most 60 s, the rest floors 15.5 and 12.4 V
     C06 CTL_SENS -> PACK [firmware]: the gauge's SMBus (FW-E01): its ranges relayed to the charger by the host; SHUTDOWN for storage (FW-E09); HWD 10 s
     C07 CTL_SENS -> LOADS [firmware]: the mixer fans (FW-E07), the Geiger supply (FW-E08), VIN_MON for FW-A16 (FW-E04)
     C08 CTL_HW -> U5 [hardware]: the hold (FBIN divider R8, R9 at 0.1 %), the regulation (IMON_IN, RIMON_IN 31.6k), the backstop comparators on SWEN, off below 2.662 V of TRK_LDO33
     C09 CTL_HW -> ENTRY [hardware]: the TPS48110-Q1's own UVLO, OV, breaker and short-circuit trip; the LM74700-Q1 blocks reverse current
     C10 CTL_HW -> FE [hardware]: U34's restart guard (R14 76.8k: 6.754 to 7.139 V); R11's average and R12's cycle-by-cycle limits
     C11 CTL_HW -> CHG [hardware]: the H3 line on ILIM_HIZ (the corrected knee), the charger's VINDPM, ACOV, BATOVP and SYSOVP; under (B1) BATDRV drives Q39 (LDO mode below VSYS_MIN)
     C12 CTL_HW -> PACK [hardware (the gauge's own firmware)]: the BQ4050's protections on its FETs (COV, CUV, OCC 5 A, OCD, SCD 60 A, UTC, OTC); the BQ7720700 drives F2
     C13 CTL_HW -> USBC [hardware]: OUTLET_OK = NOT (TR_APRS AND PA_EN), A:U30, drops both outlets while the PA keys; U18's OCP
     N01 VINRAW -> DC_IN: the tracker back-feeds DC_P through Q7's body diode (no power is delivered this way)

