   H7 a charge running on shore (added to a mode): 3.45 W; the line: LO-01a's floor 1.666 W/K (1.8058 W/K with the ballasts); +1.60 K at the binding line; on the conservative bound: LO-01a's 1.6664 W/K lid closed lies far over the bound's 0.505 to 0.537 W/K lid closed: U-01's (L4-E12 14.2); with the heat-rejection approaches: with the profile running on SC-37's design day (the air 13.2 to 18.3 C): the combined route 1.355 to 1.360 W/K against the 1.507 to 1.832 W/K charging needs, 0.153 and 0.472 W/K short; T-H1's point at the profile's heat decides at 1.575 and 1.930 W/K (L4-E12 10d, 10e)
