   R05 L4-E7R's highest regulated current: 2.9318 (l4e7_stage_settings.out: at the hold's corners, the stage's operating range); 2.9337 (l4e13_panel.out: at REQ-016's 25 V ceiling, A-3(a)'s conservative input)
