   R09 the enclosure lines (W/K): 1.666 (l4e10_cell_thermal.out: LO-01a's floor: the inside air at the SGP41's +55 C at +40 C on shore, the heat stage); 1.8058 (l4e12_thermal.out: LO-01a's floor with L4-E8's ballasts counted); 1.806 (l4e12_thermal.out: E3-O alone: the heat stage with the ballasts, +55 to +70 C); 2.159 (l4e12_thermal.out: E5 under the hold, +60 to +70 C: the BINDING line); 2.709 (l4e12_thermal.out: E5 with no hold); 2.416 (l4e12_thermal.out: T-H1's pass reading at a 10 K rise: 2.159 W/K plus its expanded uncertainty)
