   R21 the case's conductance lid open with the fans: 1.22 (pwr_budget.out: W4's lumped low case, the fans' inside film assumed (10 W/m2K)); 0.566 (l4e12_thermal.out: the conservative bound at E5, the fans' flow credited at zero); 0.607 (l4e12_thermal.out: the conservative bound at E3-O)
      kept: the bound for feasibility; W4's range as a sensitivity; why: W4's low end already assumes the fans' film, which no held document bounds (L4-E12 9c)
   R23 the conservative bound lid open at +40 C: 0.598 (l4e12_thermal.out: one node at the envelope's +40 C, the air 15 K up (9b)); 0.720 (l4e12_thermal.out: one node at E3-O's heat, its 37.6 K rise (9d)); 0.767 (l4e12_thermal.out: two nodes, the inside air and the plate, at the profile's 43.413 W (10b))
